  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - ipNX Fiber to the Premises Network Analysis, through Nationwide CLEC LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA grant funds a feasibility study for the Nigerian internet service provider, ipNX Nigeria Limited to develop an expanded fiber to the premises (FTTX) network in Lagos and other urban areas in Nigeria. This Study is expected to provide the necessary technical, economic, regulatory, and financial analysis needed to deploy an expanded FTTX network that will provide last mile connectivity to residential and commercial clusters in Lagos, Nigeria and beyond</narrative>
  </description>
